   "text": "Traces seen per round:  MILP = m,  PI-SAM = m,  V = N\nSolves: up to C(N,m) per incumbent.   Candidates: one per round, picked by V.",
   "originalText": "Traces seen per round:  MILP = m,  PI-SAM = m,  V = N\nSolves: up to C(N,m) per incumbent.   Candidates: one per round, picked by V.",
