   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Traces PI-SAM learns from, per fold size N\n\n  N :   3   4   5   6   7   8\n  SR:   3   4   5   6   7   8\nLOOP:  2   2   3   3   4   4\n\nLOOP m = max(2, ceil(N/2)) is always < N,\nso the two arms never learn from the same input.",
   "originalText": "Traces PI-SAM learns from, per fold size N\n\n  N :   3   4   5   6   7   8\n  SR:   3   4   5   6   7   8\nLOOP:  2   2   3   3   4   4\n\nLOOP m = max(2, ceil(N/2)) is always < N,\nso the two arms never learn from the same input.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 13,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "containerId": null,
