   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What this changes in the example fold\n\u2022 injected noise = 91 fluents; SR optimum = 91 \u2192 the\n  truth-consistent repair TIES with SR's repair\n\u2022 V(M_SR) = V(M_LOOP) = V(reference) = 91: V cannot\n  choose between them\n\u2022 over 209 differing noisy folds: V ties 169, SR better 40,\n  LOOP better 0",
   "originalText": "What this changes in the example fold\n\u2022 injected noise = 91 fluents; SR optimum = 91 \u2192 the\n  truth-consistent repair TIES with SR's repair\n\u2022 V(M_SR) = V(M_LOOP) = V(reference) = 91: V cannot\n  choose between them\n\u2022 over 209 differing noisy folds: V ties 169, SR better 40,\n  LOOP better 0",
